# Normalize all text to LF in the repo AND the working tree (eol=lf overrides
# core.autocrlf). Load-bearing beyond tidiness: terraform's archive_file hashes
# lambda/api/ source bytes, so CRLF churn from Windows checkouts produced
# phantom "1 to change" plans (observed 2026-08-01 audit).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries — never touch line endings.
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.mid binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.so binary
# CREPE weight shards are extensionless binary files.
frontend/public/models/crepe/group* binary
